36
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>what were you gazing at?</b></font></font></font></font>

37
00:01:42,450 --> 00:01:43,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei...</font>

38
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The mission in the Land of Birds
is over.</font>

39
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:50,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is enough.</font>

40
00:01:51,340 --> 00:01:53,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, then, what about Naruto?</font>

41
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:56,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As the leader,
I am responsible for all of this.</font>

42
00:01:58,550 --> 00:02:01,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sacrifice is an unavoidable part
of Shinobi missions.</font>

43
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:04,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now...</font>

44
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:06,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go back to our village!</font>

45
00:02:20,820 --> 00:02:24,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you think they're really going back
to their village, Nagare?</font>

46
00:02:25,410 --> 00:02:26,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps...</font>

47
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:31,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I'm concerned about that masked guy
who joined up with them later.</font>

48
00:02:32,170 --> 00:02:34,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shall I follow him, Hokushin?</font>

49
00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:39,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I'll do that.
You give the report.</font>

50
00:02:40,130 --> 00:02:40,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right.</font>

51
00:02:44,220 --> 00:02:48,390
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font color="#cdcdcc"><font color="#c9c8cd">Naruto Dies</font></font></font>

52
00:03:04,370 --> 00:03:06,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How did things turn out?</font>

53
00:03:06,330 --> 00:03:10,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The two as well as the one
who joined up with them later</font>

54
00:03:10,500 --> 00:03:12,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">seem to have crossed the border</font>

55
00:03:12,420 --> 00:03:14,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and are heading for
the Village Hidden in Leaves.</font>

56
00:03:15,750 --> 00:03:16,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

57
00:03:17,340 --> 00:03:20,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And it seems Lord Sagi took care</font>

58
00:03:20,220 --> 00:03:23,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of the one who infiltrated the residence
of the feudal lord.</font>

59
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:29,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Very nice indeed.</font>

60
00:03:37,150 --> 00:03:39,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're they doing there
for the past hour?</font>

61
00:03:42,530 --> 00:03:45,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Persimmon! What the...?</font>

62
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:50,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Ouch.
— That hurts.</font>

63
00:03:51,460 --> 00:03:52,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It couldn't be!</font>

64
00:03:59,380 --> 00:04:02,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Substitution Jutsu!
Since when...?</font>

65
00:04:06,640 --> 00:04:10,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They tricked me!
Those Leaf Shinobi...</font>

66
00:04:33,460 --> 00:04:35,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Komei... Come out.</font>

67
00:05:20,250 --> 00:05:23,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Land of Birds Tactician Komei.</font>

68
00:05:27,840 --> 00:05:30,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have abused the key position
in this land of tactician</font>

69
00:05:30,970 --> 00:05:33,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and committed the crime
of assassinating</font>

70
00:05:33,430 --> 00:05:36,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the previous feudal lord Lord Owashi
and his child Lady Toki.</font>

71
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:39,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you also ordered a subordinate</font>

72
00:05:39,650 --> 00:05:42,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to run wild as the ghost
called the Cursed Warrior,</font>

73
00:05:42,440 --> 00:05:46,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">disturbed the public, you undermined
the government of the land,</font>

74
00:05:46,780 --> 00:05:49,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">endangered Lord Sagi's position
of feudal lord</font>

75
00:05:49,950 --> 00:05:53,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and attempted to attain
the position himself,</font>

76
00:05:53,580 --> 00:05:55,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">an unforgivable crime of treason!</font>

77
00:05:57,670 --> 00:06:01,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Therefore, you are ordered
to perform seppuku!</font>

78
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:15,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... That explains it.</font>

79
00:06:17,140 --> 00:06:19,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You ensnared me,
didn't you, Moso?!</font>

80
00:06:21,770 --> 00:06:26,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're disgraceful, Komei! If you're
a warrior, kill yourself like one!</font>

81
00:06:27,490 --> 00:06:29,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Assist him with the seppuku
at once!</font>

82
00:06:29,450 --> 00:06:30,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yes, my lord!
— Yes, my lord!</font>

83
00:06:48,380 --> 00:06:50,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this it now...?</font>

84
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:04,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

85
00:07:05,110 --> 00:07:08,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hidden Mist Jutsu?
No! This is...</font>

86
00:07:13,070 --> 00:07:15,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It does not matter! Kill him!</font>

87
00:07:15,700 --> 00:07:16,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, my lord!</font>

88
00:07:16,700 --> 00:07:18,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Begging your pardon,
I shall assist!</font>

89
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:21,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are you?!</font>

90
00:07:23,170 --> 00:07:26,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this? What's going on?!</font>

91
00:07:30,760 --> 00:07:32,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— The Cursed Warrior!
— It's the Cursed Warrior...</font>

92
00:07:35,050 --> 00:07:36,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the Cursed Warrior?!</font>

93
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:37,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

94
00:07:37,390 --> 00:07:39,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After him! Don't let him get away!</font>

95
00:07:39,060 --> 00:07:39,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Right!
— Right!</font>

96
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:53,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys go after him as is...!</font>

97
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:57,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got something I want to look into,
so I'll be going on ahead!</font>

98
00:07:57,280 --> 00:07:58,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Roger!
— Roger!</font>

99
00:08:12,260 --> 00:08:15,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew it!
You two were conspirators, right?!</font>

100
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:16,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it!</font>

101
00:08:17,970 --> 00:08:20,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the guys from
the other night...</font>

102
00:08:23,940 --> 00:08:26,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've witnessed the true identity
of the ghost.</font>

103
00:08:27,310 --> 00:08:28,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's there?</font>

104
00:08:29,150 --> 00:08:30,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey, Komei.</font>

105
00:08:30,990 --> 00:08:35,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the one responsible for
controlling the Cursed Warrior, right?</font>

106
00:08:39,790 --> 00:08:41,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was also attempting
to investigate</font>

107
00:08:41,910 --> 00:08:44,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the true identity of
the Cursed Warrior that day...</font>

108
00:08:45,710 --> 00:08:50,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was almost sure it couldn't
be anyone but that person...</font>

109
00:08:51,050 --> 00:08:53,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a pain! I'll expose
the true identity here.</font>

110
00:08:57,050 --> 00:08:58,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't bother...</font>

111
00:09:00,390 --> 00:09:03,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei.
Where were you until now?</font>

112
00:09:03,560 --> 00:09:05,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll explain later. Go on ahead!</font>

113
00:09:09,820 --> 00:09:11,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry! You're going with them.</font>

114
00:09:12,110 --> 00:09:12,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

115
00:09:13,030 --> 00:09:14,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go, Tenten!</font>

116
00:09:14,780 --> 00:09:16,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, Neji!</font>

117
00:09:17,450 --> 00:09:18,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on out...</font>

118
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:21,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were following me
the whole time, right?</font>

119
00:09:35,550 --> 00:09:37,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that's your intention...</font>

120
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:41,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu!</font>

121
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:44,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it, Kakashi?</font>

122
00:09:45,350 --> 00:09:47,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Smoke out the Ninja hiding
on the temple grounds...</font>

123
00:09:47,980 --> 00:09:49,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Consider it done.</font>

124
00:09:55,490 --> 00:09:56,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! You there...</font>

125
00:09:57,490 --> 00:10:00,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hide-and-seek is over.
Come on out now!</font>

126
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:05,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't fool a dog's nose,
as would be expected...</font>

127
00:10:06,540 --> 00:10:08,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You finally grace me with
your presence, huh?</font>

128
00:10:26,020 --> 00:10:29,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is there a hole...
in a place like this?</font>

129
00:10:30,230 --> 00:10:33,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have heard the feudal lord built
secret passages such as this</font>

130
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:38,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">all over the land in order to look in
on the lives of the general public.</font>

131
00:10:38,900 --> 00:10:39,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The feudal lord?!</font>

132
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:42,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then that Cursed Warrior
has something to do</font>

133
00:10:42,450 --> 00:10:43,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the feudal lord...?</font>

134
00:10:44,240 --> 00:10:47,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At the very least,
it seems he's not a ghost.</font>

135
00:10:48,290 --> 00:10:49,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When the time comes,</font>

136
00:10:49,710 --> 00:10:52,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sure he will reveal
his true identity from his end.</font>

137
00:11:04,470 --> 00:11:06,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't it common sense for hired Ninja</font>

138
00:11:06,430 --> 00:11:10,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to return quietly to their village
after completing a mission?</font>

139
00:11:10,270 --> 00:11:14,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's different in the case of the premise
of the commissioned mission breaking down.</font>

140
00:11:15,610 --> 00:11:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There were too many
suspicious points in this mission.</font>

141
00:11:18,990 --> 00:11:22,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're sticking your nose too far
into the business of another land.</font>

142
00:11:22,990 --> 00:11:25,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here you could've returned safely
to your land</font>

143
00:11:25,160 --> 00:11:27,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if you hadn't secretively
sniffed around like a dog.</font>

144
00:11:27,620 --> 00:11:29,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excuse me for being a dog!</font>

145
00:11:37,380 --> 00:11:39,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Universal Assimilation Jutsu!</font>

146
00:11:39,470 --> 00:11:40,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Prepare yourself!</font>

147
00:11:43,090 --> 00:11:43,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

148
00:11:44,050 --> 00:11:45,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this guy?!</font>

149
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:48,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Has he introduced properties
of stone into his body?</font>

150
00:11:49,640 --> 00:11:52,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since you've learned of part
of this land's secrets,</font>

151
00:11:52,140 --> 00:11:53,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't let you live!</font>

152
00:11:54,690 --> 00:11:56,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He seems to be a somewhat
troublesome opponent.</font>

153
00:11:56,980 --> 00:11:58,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. That's good enough, Pakkun.</font>

154
00:11:58,820 --> 00:12:00,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be okay by myself from here on.</font>

155
00:12:00,820 --> 00:12:02,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... See you later!</font>

156
00:12:03,990 --> 00:12:06,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Assimilation: Rock Tank.</font>

157
00:12:07,950 --> 00:12:09,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll crush you!</font>

158
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:13,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Shadow Clone...?!</font>

159
00:12:16,750 --> 00:12:18,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is as far as it goes...</font>

160
00:12:19,090 --> 00:12:20,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be...</font>

161
00:12:21,090 --> 00:12:22,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Paper Bomb?!</font>

162
00:12:50,240 --> 00:12:52,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now... That should be enough, right?</font>

163
00:12:53,410 --> 00:12:56,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... We should be okay
having come this far.</font>

164
00:12:56,790 --> 00:12:58,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That voice...?!</font>

165
00:13:06,510 --> 00:13:08,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...!</font>

166
00:13:11,220 --> 00:13:12,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew it.</font>

167
00:13:12,850 --> 00:13:16,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The true identity of the Cursed Warrior
wasn't Lord Sagi?</font>

168
00:13:47,630 --> 00:13:48,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your...</font>

169
00:13:49,680 --> 00:13:52,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your true identity is...</font>

170
00:13:54,560 --> 00:13:58,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Sagi?! It is you, Lord Sagi?</font>

171
00:14:04,150 --> 00:14:06,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From the way he was standing still,</font>

172
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:08,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought for sure it was Lord Sagi.</font>

173
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:11,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a profound reason for this...</font>

174
00:14:13,330 --> 00:14:14,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing, Tenten?!</font>

175
00:14:14,790 --> 00:14:17,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then tell me sooner!</font>

176
00:14:17,660 --> 00:14:20,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems you also knew
it was Naruto, Neji.</font>

177
00:14:20,500 --> 00:14:22,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... Ages ago.</font>

178
00:14:22,420 --> 00:14:24,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, you two!</font>

179
00:14:24,380 --> 00:14:26,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was really worried!</font>

180
00:14:26,970 --> 00:14:30,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There was a surveillance Shinobi
following us the whole time, right?</font>

181
00:14:35,680 --> 00:14:37,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji, Tenten... Don't look back.</font>

182
00:14:38,350 --> 00:14:39,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're being followed!</font>

183
00:14:48,820 --> 00:14:52,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're going back to the Land of Birds.
Just do as I say... Got it?!</font>

184
00:14:52,660 --> 00:14:53,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

185
00:14:54,450 --> 00:14:55,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Understood...</font>

186
00:14:57,450 --> 00:15:00,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But didn't we shake the pursuer
with Substitution?</font>

187
00:15:00,460 --> 00:15:02,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... Once...</font>

188
00:15:08,010 --> 00:15:08,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

189
00:15:08,800 --> 00:15:11,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when we chased the Cursed Warrior
from the execution grounds...</font>

190
00:15:11,800 --> 00:15:13,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a different Shinobi followed us.</font>

191
00:15:16,470 --> 00:15:19,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez... Am I the only one
who didn't know?</font>

192
00:15:19,690 --> 00:15:21,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was a waste to worry!</font>

193
00:15:21,690 --> 00:15:24,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then you,
in the place of Lord Sagi...?</font>

194
00:15:24,610 --> 00:15:25,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

195
00:15:25,650 --> 00:15:28,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... So Lord Sagi is safe!</font>

196
00:15:29,400 --> 00:15:31,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You okay, mister?!</font>

197
00:15:31,450 --> 00:15:32,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...</font>

198
00:15:32,610 --> 00:15:34,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Moso acted rashly,</font>

199
00:15:34,740 --> 00:15:38,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">forcing me to make
a false confession.</font>

200
00:15:38,950 --> 00:15:42,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, you've been beaten up good.</font>

201
00:15:42,830 --> 00:15:45,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, we'll tell you about
the developments inside.</font>

202
00:15:45,630 --> 00:15:46,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sagi is waiting!</font>

203
00:15:56,180 --> 00:15:57,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Assimilation: Rock Shower!</font>

204
00:16:03,650 --> 00:16:05,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're Wandering Shinobi...</font>

205
00:16:05,980 --> 00:16:09,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We make do without having a village
by going around to every village,</font>

206
00:16:09,440 --> 00:16:13,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">stealing Jutsu and
devising new Ninjutsu.</font>

207
00:16:14,450 --> 00:16:17,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For example,
a Jutsu like this one, too...</font>

208
00:16:19,620 --> 00:16:21,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say what?</font>

209
00:16:24,080 --> 00:16:25,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sharingan!</font>

210
00:16:26,250 --> 00:16:28,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Assimilation: Sand Coffin!</font>

211
00:16:30,920 --> 00:16:32,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's using the same Jutsu
as Gaara!</font>

212
00:16:34,680 --> 00:16:36,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Assimilation: Sand Funeral!</font>

213
00:16:44,690 --> 00:16:45,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sagi!</font>

214
00:16:46,690 --> 00:16:48,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How's Chishima doing...?</font>

215
00:16:50,980 --> 00:16:54,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's okay...
There's no threat to his life.</font>

216
00:16:55,160 --> 00:16:57,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's resting and receiving treatment</font>

217
00:16:57,820 --> 00:16:59,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the treatment room
of my residence.</font>

218
00:17:05,210 --> 00:17:06,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's good...</font>

219
00:17:06,580 --> 00:17:08,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did something happen to Chishima?</font>

220
00:17:08,630 --> 00:17:10,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who...? Who hurt him?!</font>

221
00:17:11,090 --> 00:17:13,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Komei... I'm sorry for
the misunderstanding!</font>

222
00:17:14,050 --> 00:17:16,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My lord, I don't deserve
those magnanimous words!</font>

223
00:17:17,890 --> 00:17:21,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Although he had suffered injuries,
Chishima came to tell me.</font>

224
00:17:24,180 --> 00:17:25,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At that time...</font>

225
00:17:29,770 --> 00:17:31,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must not let you live as is</font>

226
00:17:31,480 --> 00:17:33,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">now that you have learned
of everything!</font>

227
00:17:33,650 --> 00:17:36,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As the thief who snuck into
the residence of the feudal lord,</font>

228
00:17:36,490 --> 00:17:38,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">your fate is the death sentence!</font>

229
00:17:40,370 --> 00:17:41,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...!</font>

230
00:17:42,790 --> 00:17:43,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Sagi...</font>

231
00:17:45,080 --> 00:17:46,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Chishima?!
— Bro!</font>

232
00:17:51,090 --> 00:17:52,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shuriken wounds...?</font>

233
00:17:52,880 --> 00:17:54,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go to the residence doctor!</font>

234
00:17:55,170 --> 00:17:56,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Sagi...</font>

235
00:17:56,630 --> 00:17:57,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please listen...</font>

236
00:17:58,390 --> 00:18:02,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Moso, no,
Moso has betrayed you...</font>

237
00:18:02,760 --> 00:18:03,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

238
00:18:04,520 --> 00:18:06,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moso was the one</font>

239
00:18:06,060 --> 00:18:09,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who killed your father, Lord Owashi,
and Lady Toki!</font>

240
00:18:13,110 --> 00:18:17,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And Moso had his own Ninja henchmen
use the guardsmen shuriken</font>

241
00:18:17,280 --> 00:18:19,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to falsely accuse Lord Komei...</font>

242
00:18:20,780 --> 00:18:24,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sure Lord Komei learned
of Moso's scheme and...</font>

243
00:18:25,290 --> 00:18:27,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hang in there, Chishima!</font>

244
00:18:28,210 --> 00:18:33,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Sagi, please...
Stop Lord Komei's execution.</font>

245
00:18:34,130 --> 00:18:36,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have to go save him quickly!</font>

246
00:18:36,760 --> 00:18:38,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must not stop the execution!</font>

247
00:18:38,720 --> 00:18:40,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is that?!</font>

248
00:18:40,930 --> 00:18:42,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't be able to have my revenge</font>

249
00:18:42,600 --> 00:18:46,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if Moso realizes that
I have learned the truth...</font>

250
00:18:46,100 --> 00:18:48,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you saying it doesn't matter
who is sacrificed</font>

251
00:18:48,440 --> 00:18:50,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if it's for the sake of your revenge?!</font>

252
00:18:50,600 --> 00:18:51,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then what would you do?</font>

253
00:18:51,860 --> 00:18:54,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Komei is being kept under strict watch
by powerful soldiers.</font>

254
00:18:54,980 --> 00:18:58,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We would have no chance of winning
if they were to cause a rebellion there.</font>

255
00:18:58,490 --> 00:19:02,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll go!
I will save Komei on my own!</font>

256
00:19:02,780 --> 00:19:04,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't have a problem
with that, do you?</font>

257
00:19:06,080 --> 00:19:07,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Sagi...</font>

258
00:19:10,580 --> 00:19:11,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do as you like.</font>

259
00:19:13,500 --> 00:19:17,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And so I disguised myself
as the Cursed Warrior.</font>

260
00:19:17,590 --> 00:19:20,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I played the part of Cursed Warrior</font>

261
00:19:20,880 --> 00:19:23,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and attempted to look for
the assassination culprit...</font>

262
00:19:42,280 --> 00:19:44,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But against my intentions...</font>

263
00:19:45,780 --> 00:19:47,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Instead of finding
the true culprit...</font>

264
00:19:48,080 --> 00:19:53,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Komei... I was used as a tool
to incriminate you.</font>

265
00:19:55,250 --> 00:19:58,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought the Cursed Warrior
I encountered in my bedroom</font>

266
00:19:58,590 --> 00:20:00,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was you, Lord Sagi.</font>

267
00:20:02,220 --> 00:20:04,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And so I headed for
the abandoned temple</font>

268
00:20:04,390 --> 00:20:06,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">where the Cursed Warrior
once vanished.</font>

269
00:20:09,430 --> 00:20:12,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There I encountered
the Cursed Warrior, but...</font>

270
00:20:13,310 --> 00:20:15,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Cursed Warrior wasn't me.</font>

271
00:20:16,270 --> 00:20:18,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps it was a fake
that Moso devised.</font>

272
00:20:19,280 --> 00:20:23,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it!
All of it was that old man Moso's trap!</font>

273
00:20:24,160 --> 00:20:25,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Moso!</font>

274
00:20:26,200 --> 00:20:27,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did he think to first dispose
of me</font>

275
00:20:28,080 --> 00:20:30,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and then eventually attempt to rule
the Land of Birds</font>

276
00:20:30,700 --> 00:20:32,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by doing away with Lord Sagi?</font>

277
00:20:33,330 --> 00:20:35,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy acting like a good guy!</font>

278
00:20:35,330 --> 00:20:37,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll grab him up and kick his butt!</font>

279
00:20:37,170 --> 00:20:39,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, was it?
You did good work.</font>

280
00:20:39,840 --> 00:20:40,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

281
00:20:42,380 --> 00:20:44,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will take care of things
from here on!</font>

282
00:20:45,890 --> 00:20:47,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... But...</font>

283
00:20:48,050 --> 00:20:51,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will even the score by myself.</font>

284
00:20:56,190 --> 00:20:57,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As long as the score isn't settled...</font>

285
00:20:58,480 --> 00:21:03,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the clock inside my heart...
will remain stopped in the past!</font>

286
00:21:19,960 --> 00:21:31,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>dokomademo tsudzuku michi ni wa ironna koto arunda ne</b></font></font></font></font>

287
00:21:19,960 --> 00:21:31,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>so many things happen on this endless road, right?</b></font></font></font></font>

288
00:21:31,640 --> 00:21:43,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>tsuyogari na kimi ga kyou wa juwaki koshi ni namida koe</b></font></font></font></font>

289
00:21:31,640 --> 00:21:43,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>although you're strong-willed your voice wavered on the phone today</b></font></font></font></font>

290
00:21:43,240 --> 00:21:54,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>donna yume oikakete kokomade kitan darou</b></font></font></font></font>

291
00:21:43,240 --> 00:21:54,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>what dreams did you chase to get here?</b></font></font></font></font>

292
00:21:54,030 --> 00:22:06,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>wakara na kunattari suru koto wa boku ni datte aru kara nee BABY</b></font></font></font></font>

293
00:21:54,030 --> 00:22:06,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even I have times when I just don't understand baby</b></font></font></font></font>

294
00:22:06,370 --> 00:22:17,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>kimi ga namida no toki ni wa boku ga soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

295
00:22:06,370 --> 00:22:17,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>when you're sad I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

296
00:22:17,890 --> 00:22:29,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>hanareba nare no yoru datte boku wa soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

297
00:22:17,890 --> 00:22:29,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even on nights when we're apart I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

298
00:22:29,490 --> 00:22:35,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>boku wa soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

299
00:22:29,490 --> 00:22:35,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

300
00:22:40,290 --> 00:22:42,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What do you mean you will
even the score on your own?!</font>

301
00:22:43,000 --> 00:22:45,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What good can you do
going by yourself?!</font>

302
00:22:46,050 --> 00:22:50,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Even if you did avenge them,
the dead won't come back!</font>

303
00:22:51,010 --> 00:22:53,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Do you still insist on having revenge?!</font>

304
00:22:54,310 --> 00:22:56,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Would that make you
feel better?!</font>

305
00:22:56,640 --> 00:23:01,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Would that really make
your father and sister happy?!</font>

306
00:23:02,230 --> 00:23:04,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"When Time Stands Still."</font>

